  "body": " `data:text/html,<a href=\"data:text/html,link followed\">[<input type=button value=\"test\"> ]</a><input type=\"button\" value=\"click() on the first button\" onclick=\"setTimeout('document.getElementsByTagName(\\'input\\')[0].click()', 0)\">`\n\ndispatches click event to a child node of `<a>`, yet `<a>` is supposed to be activated.\nPer spec that shouldn't happen. I think the spec should be updated to follow the reality.\n",
